# G1 piston verified results: rendered rollouts and per-rollout state traces.
# The videos and their sidecars are large binary/verbose artifacts regenerated by
# tools/g1_piston/run_render_queue.sh; the manifests and tables that summarise them
# are small and ARE tracked, so a reviewer gets the evidence index from git and the
# footage from the working tree.
verified_results/videos/
verified_results/contact_sheets/*.png
verified_results/**/*.mp4
verified_results/**/*.log
